\u0015(nk ) for all end-nodes of the arcs\n                             inserted in ARC;\n                                      update OPEN;\n                             update SETV;\n                             End;\n         End;\n         With the ordered set ARC generate the sequence of patterns from\n         Gp and G to obtain \u0002’.\n\f                     J.C. Becceneri et al. / Computers & Operations Research 31 (2004) 2315 – 2332            2319\n\nTable 1\nMatrix of patterns × pieces\n\nPattern           Piece\n\n                 p1              p2           p3            p4           p5            p6                p7    p8\n\nP1               1               1            1             0            0             0                 0     0\nP2               1               0            0             1            0             0                 0     0\nP3               1               0            0             0            1             0                 0     0\nP4               1               0            0             0            0             1                 0     0\nP5               1               0            0             0            0             0                 1     0\nP6               1               0            0             0            0             0                 0     1\nP7               0               1            0             0            1             0                 0     0\nP8               0               1            0             0            0             0                 1     0\nP9               0               0            1             0            1             0                 0     0\nP10              0               0            0             1            0             1                 0     0\nP11              0               0            0             1            0             0                 0     1\nP12              0               0            0             0            1             1       